                <pb facs="0308" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg224"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>No. 84.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis
                        to Mr. Beach.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 30,
                        1884</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Julio Romano Santos, American, imprisoned at Guayaquil. Urge speedy and fair
                    trial.</p>
                <closer><signed>DAVIS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
